WEBVTT

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:09.840
Light and Darkness.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.690
The final battle of the gods
climaxed in a clash between...

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:17.900
Marfa, Goddess of All Creation,
and Kardis, Goddess of Destruction.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:22.700
At the end of their fierce
battle, the stricken goddesses...

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:27.300
had split the continent,
forming a new land.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.720
Since then, people have come
to call this new continent...

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:36.010
"Lodoss - The Accursed Island."

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:08.230
You still defy me?!

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:16.070
You think that Kardis
has chosen you?!

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:22.740
She may be a goddess,
but she's obviously quite mad!

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.970
You dare to blaspheme
against her.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:51.190
Soon I shall be
granted eternal life!

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:53.850
No one will interfere
with me then!

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:58.030
No army will stand before me!

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.200
What in...?!

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:31.500
Why is it...?

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:47.850
Ashram! He's alive?!

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:02.970
Mycen!

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:26.860
Look at them!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:28.030
They're still alive?!

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:34.450
Can it be Kardis?!

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.970
No, if she were reborn she wouldn't
resort to these petty tricks.

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:40.450
Parn and the others must
still be fighting them!

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:42.120
They're still alive?

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:46.570
Yes, which means we can't accept
Death's invitations quite yet!

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:47.050
Highness!

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.180
Let's go!

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.500
He's the Mercenary King,
all right!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.540
Ashram!

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:39.900
The ghosts of Beld and Fahn
still hold some influence, eh?

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:44.230
The opposing swords.
Even they will be destroyed here!

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:58.290
I'll send both sword-wielders
to the next world!

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:18.850
What now? Can you no longer
raise your hand against me?

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:23.270
Time to send you off
from this existence.

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:28.720
First you, Ashram! Go to
your beloved emperor's side!

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:38.950
Now you die!

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:49.880
Now what, boy?
Trying to protect Ashram?

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:52.890
Deed. Give her back!

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:55.630
Too late!

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:59.780
Even now the elf's eternal life
is being absorbed by Kardis!

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:00.390
Look!

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:05.900
DEED!

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:14.200
Fool!
This is the end!

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.720
For you.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:17.740
You–

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:31.060
It means nothing!

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:34.030
Kardis has granted
me eternal life!

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:38.540
Kardis, what's wrong?
Give me power–!

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:37.700
DEED!

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:40.200
Parn.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:54.960
Deed!

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:01.800
Ashram!

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:33.430
And what of your pawns?

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:41.830
Will you just stand back
and allow Kardis' resurrection?

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:46.100
Is that what you've
survived 500 years for?

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.510
I gamble.

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:50.410
My purpose is to preserve Lodoss.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:54.120
If there were no survivors,
it would be meaningless.

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:57.230
You're gambling with them?!

00:11:57.680 --> 00:12:02.110
Karla, even you cannot count
yourself among the gods.

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:16.500
Why?! Why do we have
to fight each other?!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.010
Deed!

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:29.340
You want Kardis to be reborn?!

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:31.520
She'll destroy Marmo
right along with Lodoss!

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:35.050
Light or Darkness.

00:12:35.050 --> 00:12:38.980
Between you and I,
all will be decided!

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:15.790
I won't be beaten!
Kardis has chosen me!

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:17.760
Not you!

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:32.190
The destiny of Darkness.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:50.020
Let Kardis be reborn!
Let destruction reign!

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:52.500
Let all be plunged
back into darkness!

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:55.660
Without the
Scepter of Domination...

00:14:55.660 --> 00:15:00.920
THE WORLD WILL BE YOURS!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:08.060
Now no one will be
able to control Kardis!

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:11.170
Lodoss is doomed!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:15.850
Nothing will remain!
Nothing!

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:42.330
Deed... DEED!

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:02.810
No. Stay back.

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:06.820
Save yourself, Parn.
Stay back.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.920
Hang on, Deed.

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:33.840
Hang on!

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:41.910
Stay back... Parn...
Save yourself...

00:16:58.270 --> 00:16:58.990
Parn.

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:09.650
What the devil?!

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:13.940
Well, what now?

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:17.830
Did you come here only
to lecture me, Wort?

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:21.880
We once fought side by side.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:25.620
Surely you don't mind my
observing an old friend's destiny.

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:32.210
Perhaps not.
But know this:

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:36.320
Should the balance of
power on Lodoss tip again...

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:42.610
then you and I
will meet once more.

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.520
The kingdom of Valis was
a confusion of exultation.

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:15.570
Prayers gave way to shouts of
congratulations and songs of joy.

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:21.470
People proclaimed the young man
who had subdued Marmo a knight...

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:26.480
and in Lodoss,
a new hero was born.

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:49.510
The sword and
armor of a Holy Knight.

00:19:49.510 --> 00:19:51.370
Do you think Parn will
look good in them?

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:53.040
I'm sure.

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.120
You're going?

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:13.200
Highness, I...

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:17.480
I won't stop you.
However...

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:19.990
I ask only that you take this.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:30.820
I expect to see you again.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:32.790
Yes, sir.

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:35.500
Knight of Lodoss.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:40.010
Never forget the
title you now hold.

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:41.780
Highness!

00:21:23.600 --> 00:21:25.820
Trying to sneak off
without me?

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:30.560
Lodoss can be a very large place
when you're out there all alone.

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:49.660
They'll be back, Parn and Deed.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:50.530
We'll wait for them.

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:56.830
The paths Parn and we travel
will surely cross again some day.

00:21:57.260 --> 00:21:58.040
Yes.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:01.110
I wonder if our business
is really finished here.

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:03.050
We can only hope.

00:22:03.730 --> 00:22:04.740
Parn.

00:22:19.050 --> 00:22:22.160
There was once a boy
who dreamed of being a hero.

00:22:22.960 --> 00:22:25.660
Who believed sincerely
in the battle...

00:22:25.660 --> 00:22:28.640
to banish darkness
from a world of light.

00:22:29.400 --> 00:22:33.450
But light and
darkness are equal.

00:22:34.180 --> 00:22:37.650
And where one exists,
so too must the other.

00:22:38.450 --> 00:22:41.710
And when the boy
finally realized this...

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:45.940
he had taken the first step
towards becoming a true hero.
